  <h2>How to Ship Safely: The DDP Advantage</h2>
  <p>
    To navigate this, Kakobuy has introduced specialized <strong>Tax-Free (DDP)</strong> lines. Unlike standard EMS or SAL, which rely on the recipient to handle customs if flagged, DDP (Delivered Duty Paid) lines use pre-cleared commercial channels.
  </p>
  <ul>
