    <li><strong>Prepaid Duties:</strong> Kakobuy handles the duty payment upfront (included in your shipping fee), removing the "Type 86" risk surface.</li>
    <li><strong>East Coast Speed:</strong> New "Fast-Track Tax-Free" routes are currently hitting the US East Coast in under 12 days.</li>
